---
// eSIM vs SIM física — match PSD artboard 0:
// Comparte bg con MovilPlanTypes (lo aplica el wrapper en telefonia-movil.astro).
// Cards con imágenes reales extraídas del PSD (esim-card.webp + sim-card.webp).
---

<section class="relative pt-8 md:pt-12 pb-14 md:pb-20 overflow-hidden bg-transparent">
  <div class="relative max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4">
    <div class="text-center mb-10">
      <h2 class="font-unbounded text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-panda-dark mb-3">
        eSIM o SIM física: tú eliges
      </h2>
      <p class="font-poppins text-sm sm:text-base text-panda-gray max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        Activa al instante con eSIM o recibe tu chip a domicilio. La misma red, el mismo plan, dos formas de empezar.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-5 md:gap-7 max-w-4xl mx-auto">

      <!-- eSIM CARD -->
      <article class="relative bg-white rounded-3xl shadow-xl shadow-panda-dark/10 overflow-hidden border border-gray-100 hover:-translate-y-1 transition-transform duration-300">
        <!-- Badges top -->
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 px-5 pt-4">
          <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full text-panda-green text-[10px] font-bold font-poppins">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-panda-green"></span>
            RECOMENDADO
          </span>
          <span class="font-poppins text-[11px] font-semibold text-panda-gray">5 minutos</span>
        </div>
        <!-- Imagen eSIM 1000x1000 (1:1) en container aspect-[3/2] con object-cover:
             mismo size que SIM card, sin dominar la card -->
        <div class="px-4 pt-2 bg-white">
          <img
            src="/img/banners/services/esim-card.webp"
            alt="eSIM digital"
            width="1000"
            height="1000"
            class="block w-full aspect-[3/2] object-cover object-center rounded-xl"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>

        <!-- Bottom: white content -->
        <div class="p-6">
          <h3 class="font-unbounded text-xl font-bold text-panda-dark mb-2">eSIM digital</h3>
          <p class="font-poppins text-sm text-panda-gray mb-4 leading-relaxed">
            Escaneas un QR y listo. Sin chip físico, sin envíos, sin esperar.
          </p>
          <ul class="space-y-2 mb-5">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2 font-poppins text-[13px] text-panda-dark">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 mt-0.5 text-panda-green flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
              Activación en <strong>5 minutos</strong>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2 font-poppins text-[13px] text-panda-dark">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 mt-0.5 text-panda-green flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
              Compatible con iPhone XR+, Pixel 3+, Galaxy S20+
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2 font-poppins text-[13px] text-panda-dark">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 mt-0.5 text-panda-green flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
              Cambia de número sin perder señal
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2 font-poppins text-[13px] text-panda-dark">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 mt-0.5 text-panda-green flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
              Sin riesgo de perder el chip
            </li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/contrata/?type=esim" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-poppins text-sm font-bold text-panda-red-dark hover:gap-3 transition-all">
            Activar mi eSIM
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3"/></svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- SIM FÍSICA CARD -->
      <article class="relative bg-white rounded-3xl shadow-xl shadow-panda-dark/10 overflow-hidden border border-gray-100 hover:-translate-y-1 transition-transform duration-300">
        <!-- Badges top -->
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 px-5 pt-4">
          <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full text-panda-green text-[10px] font-bold font-poppins">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-panda-green"></span>
            RECOMENDADO
          </span>
          <span class="font-poppins text-[11px] font-semibold text-panda-gray">24-48h envío</span>
        </div>
        <!-- Imagen SIM 1499x1000 (3:2 nativo) en container aspect-[3/2] - mismo size eSIM -->
        <div class="px-4 pt-2 bg-white">
          <img
            src="/img/banners/services/sim-card.webp"
            alt="SIM física"
            width="1499"
            height="1000"
            class="block w-full aspect-[3/2] object-cover object-center rounded-xl"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>

        <!-- Bottom: white content -->
        <div class="p-6">
          <h3 class="font-unbounded text-xl font-bold text-panda-dark mb-2">SIM física</h3>
          <p class="font-poppins text-sm text-panda-gray mb-4 leading-relaxed">
            Te enviamos el chip a tu domicilio o recógelo en un punto autorizado.
          </p>
          <ul class="space-y-2 mb-5">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2 font-poppins text-[13px] text-panda-dark">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 mt-0.5 text-panda-green flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
              Compatible con <strong>cualquier celular</strong>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2 font-poppins text-[13px] text-panda-dark">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 mt-0.5 text-panda-green flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
              Envío a toda la república
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2 font-poppins text-[13px] text-panda-dark">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 mt-0.5 text-panda-green flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
              Formato Nano/Micro/Estándar (3-in-1)
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2 font-poppins text-[13px] text-panda-dark">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 mt-0.5 text-panda-green flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
              Recogida también en distribuidores
            </li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/contrata/?type=sim" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-poppins text-sm font-bold text-panda-red-dark hover:gap-3 transition-all">
            Pedir mi SIM física
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3"/></svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </article>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
